//! anthropic — a hand-written client for the Anthropic Messages API.
//!
//! Import as: import anthropic
//!
//! **Status: a forcing function, not yet a client.** It exists to answer the
//! typed-JSON question in [docs/typed-json.md](../../docs/typed-json.md) with real
//! code rather than a prediction — so today it is the Messages *response* types
//! and their decoders, exercised against recorded response bodies. No credential,
//! no socket, no live call. The rest (auth, retries, streaming, the request side)
//! is [docs/api-access.md](../../docs/api-access.md) Arc 2.
//!
//! ```thera
//! let msg = anthropic.message_from_json(json.parse(body)?)?;
//! for block in msg.content {
//!     match block {
//!         Text(t) => print(t.text),
//!         _ => void,
//!     }
//! }
//! ```
//!
//! This is a barrel: it re-exports its sibling files and defines nothing itself.

pub import 'decode'; // DecodeError, and the field readers every decoder needs
pub import 'messages'; // Message, ContentBlock, StopReason, Usage
